@startuml
' The two states a game can be in, and the commands that move it between them
hide empty description

[*] --> OnShelf : add

state "On the shelf" as OnShelf
state "Lent out" as Lent

OnShelf --> Lent : lend INDEX /to NAME
Lent --> OnShelf : return INDEX

OnShelf --> OnShelf : edit / tag / untag / sort
Lent --> Lent : edit / tag / untag / sort

OnShelf --> [*] : delete
Lent --> [*] : delete

note left of OnShelf
  Can be suggested by
  filter and pick
end note

note left of Lent
  Left out of filter and pick,
  which name it and its borrower
end note
@enduml
